GoGoBible language packs

This repository's release files contain Vosk speech recognition models
by Alpha Cephei Inc. (https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The model files are unmodified. GoGoBible only repackaged them into one zip per language:
the model's top folder was renamed to asr/, and bundle.json, SOURCE.txt, NOTICE.txt and
LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt were added.

Models:
  es  vosk-model-small-es-0.42
  pt  vosk-model-small-pt-0.3
  zh  vosk-model-small-cn-0.22
  ja  vosk-model-small-ja-0.22
  fr  vosk-model-small-fr-0.22
  de  vosk-model-small-de-0.15
  ru  vosk-model-small-ru-0.22
  hi  vosk-model-small-hi-0.22
